      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HURRICANE ETHICS (2) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw then burst clear to score (19.83) at this track in a Grade 5 over 340m. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Well placed and will be tough to beat. TOMMY THE FROG (1) showed good early speed and led throughout to score at big odds last time when a one length winner at this track over 340m (19.72). Form at the trip sound including three wins. The form out of his last race has been franked. Likely to be in the finish. MY CAPE ESCAPE (3) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in his fast 17.44 win at Taree Super Track over 300m. Top win two back and can measure up again. ZIPPING BAFF (6) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
